    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This property controls the sensor’s sensitivity to light by applying a gain value to the signal.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 신호에 이득 값을 적용하여 센서의 빛 민감도를 제어합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "8df886a82e615f725dcc6ad929b18865ce8b59c53c9bb8dc3564a8917f0a8c5c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "This value is between the active format’s [`minISO`](avcapturedevice/format/miniso.md) and [`maxISO`](avcapturedevice/format/maxiso.md) values.",
      "ko": "이 값은 활성 형식의 [`minISO`](avcapturedevice/format/miniso.md) 값과 [`maxISO`](avcapturedevice/format/maxiso.md) 값 사이에 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "6165b9e691eba571adfc4dc966f28b6eb0144de22ebe8354602c8b503157cc8c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "Higher values result in noisier images.",
      "ko": "값이 클수록 이미지에 더 많은 노이즈가 발생합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "20b75a70485209c753f08f9049d7cfb310bc85d1c6177c106413e64e186eb43c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "To set the ISO, call the [`setExposureModeCustom(duration:iso:completionHandler:)`](avcapturedevice/setexposuremodecustom(duration:iso:completionhandler:).md) method.",
      "ko": "ISO를 설정하려면 [`setExposureModeCustom(duration:iso:completionHandler:)`](avcapturedevice/setexposuremodecustom(duration:iso:completionhandler:).md) 메서드를 호출합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f8aa498f2ed78f8ea52d3bf8f8c34a900689f7f2f861ce316a7a8bdceaaabdae",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "This property is key-value observable.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 키-값 관찰 가능합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "da10f6fb15a1291aedea3de21f0a99a0321c2e86790d0f3fd44477cca7d3c9a7",
      "status": "machine_translated"
